FmRadio — FM radio for the MT6575 LGs (LG L4 II, L5 II) on CyanogenMod.

The icons (res/drawable-*/btn_fm_*, fb_red, fm_title_icon, fm_playing_state,
ic_headest_null, ic_launcher_fmradio), the colors and layout design and the
translated strings in res/values*/aosp_strings.xml come from AOSP's FM Radio
app (packages/apps/FMRadio, Android 5.1):

    Copyright (C) 2014 The Android Open Source Project
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Only the resources this app uses were kept, and only the mdpi/hdpi images
these phones need. The code is new and talks to the stock MediaTek
libfmjni.so through com.mediatek.FMRadio.FMRadioNative.
